Ajayeb original art: CC BY 4.0
===============================

This license covers the original art in this repository:

- `art/style.md`, `art/subjects.json` and `art/manifest.json` (the prompts
  and data that produce the art)
- `art/refs/` (approved style anchors)
- `art/originals/` (approved bitmap originals, as generated)
- `web/static/art/` (the shipped AVIF derivatives of those originals)
- `web/src/lib/icons/svg/` (the hand-drawn SVG icon set)

It does not cover the rest of the repository. Code is MIT-licensed; see
[`LICENSE`](../LICENSE) at the repository root. [`docs/legal.md`](../docs/legal.md)
has the full picture, including the fonts' licenses and what the art is
never allowed to copy from the original board game.

Licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International License
(CC BY 4.0). You are free to share and adapt this material for any purpose,
even commercially, as long as you give appropriate credit, provide a link
to the license, and indicate if changes were made.

- Human-readable summary: <https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/>
- Full legal text: <https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/legalcode>

Suggested attribution:

> Ajayeb original art by NightMachinery, licensed under CC BY 4.0
> (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/).
> Source: https://github.com/NightMachinery/ajayeb

The owner may change this license before any art is published; see
`docs/legal.md` for the current status.
